{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56070","headline":"寿邓将军 一 · 杜光庭","name":"寿邓将军 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文星一夜动天关，此日真仙降世间。\n千里光华蟾影满，九臯空阔鹤情闲。\n临戎暂许分忧寄，入相看随急诏还。\n自愧嘉辰无异礼，只将吟咏祝崇山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}